ramify 1
module daemon tagged [dispatch]

// N5: only the context vocabulary and controlled ports currently implemented.
expose-sub ContextId, GenerationId, RevisionId, LeaseId, ContextToken, ContextSetup, ContextSelection, InputFingerprints, WatchEvent, WatcherHandle, WatcherPort, ClockPort, createControlledWatcher, createControlledClock, ControlledWatcher, ControlledClock from contexts to parent
